<span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111;letter-spacing:0.02em;">INDICE COMPOSÉ S&amp;P/TSX&nbsp;: CLÔTURE QUOTIDIENNE</span>
<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">36&nbsp;324,99</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#2e7d32;">&#9650; 0,60&nbsp;%</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">QUOTIDIEN &nbsp;|&nbsp; 16 SEPT. AU 21 OCT. 2026</span>
</div>
